# Loaded by `vite build` only (Cloudflare Workers Build, local `npm run build`).
#
# Do not set VITE_API_URL here. Production bundles use apiOrigin() →
# window.location.origin and call /api/v1/… on the Workers host; the Worker
# proxies to Render (API_ORIGIN in wrangler.jsonc).
#
# Local dev (`npm run dev`) uses .env / defaults → http://localhost:8000.
# To point a one-off production build at a local API, use an uncommitted
# apps/web/.env.production.local with VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:8000.
